graph LR
    SparkOp["Spark Operator<br/>module controller + controller + webhook"]

    %% Internal platform
    ODHOp["opendatahub-operator<br/>rhods-operator"] -->|deploys module,<br/>creates SparkOperator CR| SparkOp
    SparkOp -->|PlatformObject contract,<br/>kustomize render| PlatUtils["odh-platform-utilities"]
    Monitoring["ODH/RHOAI monitoring stack"] -->|PodMonitor scrape HTTPS 8080| SparkOp
    Workbench["Workbenches / odh-dashboard ns"] -->|gRPC 15002 to SparkConnect| SparkOp
    SDK["Kubeflow SDK<br/>kubeflow.spark"] -->|creates SparkConnect CRs| SparkOp
    SparkOp -->|base image| AIPCC["AIPCC CPU base image<br/>cpu-el9.8"]

    %% Platform services
    SparkOp -->|REST + watch, admission| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    SparkOp -->|TLS profile| OCPConfig["OpenShift config API<br/>apiservers/cluster"]
    ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"] -->|metrics certs + CA bundle| SparkOp
    SparkOp -->|PodMonitor CRD| PromOp["Prometheus Operator"]

    %% Runtime libs
    SparkOp -->|spark-submit runtime| PySpark["PySpark 4.0.4 + py4j"]
    SparkOp -->|JVM| JDK["OpenJDK 17"]
    SparkOp -->|PID 1| Catatonit["catatonit via podman RPM"]

    %% Go libs
    SparkOp -->|framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.23.3"]
    SparkOp -->|clients| ClientGo["client-go v0.35"]
    SparkOp -->|TLS cipher mapping| OCPLib["openshift/api, library-go"]
    SparkOp -->|cron| Cron["robfig/cron v3.0.1"]
    SparkOp -->|metrics| PromGo["prometheus client_golang v1.23.2"]

    %% Optional
    SparkOp -.->|batch scheduler opt-in| Volcano["Volcano / YuniKorn /<br/>scheduler-plugins"]
    SparkOp -.->|optional webhook certs,<br/>not used in RHOAI| CertManager["cert-manager"]
    SparkOp -.->|RestSubmitter gate, disabled| Submitter["Spark submitter service"]
    SparkOp -.->|optional UI exposure| OCPIngress["OpenShift Ingress"]
    SparkOp -->|user dependency URLs,<br/>allow-all egress| Ext["Arbitrary external endpoints"]

    style SparkOp fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px,color:#fff
    style ODHOp fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style PlatUtils fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style Monitoring fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style Workbench fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style SDK fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style AIPCC fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
